                                "sense_id": "44de5f44-b80b-3beb-9445-c6390a4fc7d7",
                                "text": "Well-to-do citizens, both Reformed and Catholic, also backed down and withdrew their demands, forming a united front to suppress the revolt in the cities, either through hardhandedness or appeasement."
